ct with a main method that prints \\\"Hello, World!\\\".\\n\\nWe'll also add comments and possibly a build/run instruction.\\n\\nSince the issue says: \\\"If applicable, include build/run instructions in a comment at the top of the file\\\"\\n\\nWe can include instructions for running with `scala` or `scalac` and `scala`.\\n\\nLet's create the file.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-abb3db47-cf5b-4be4-9693-b0b690ed4efa\",\"content\":\"\",\"name\":\"write\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-6bdeafff-fe70-4d5b-b174-cd0c5e8ede29\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"mkdir -p ci\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Create ci directory\\\"}\"}}],\"reasoning\":\"Now, we need to create the GitHub Actions workflow in the `ci/` directory.\\n\\nFirst, let's create the `ci` directory if it doesn't exist.\",\"reasoning_details\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"Now, we need to create the GitHub Actions workflow in the `ci/` directory.\\n\\nFirst, let's create the `ci` directory if it doesn't exist.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-6bdeafff-fe70-4d5b-b174-cd0c5e8ede29\",\"content\":\"\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-f50bf215-a974-4f79-a3f6-bec60a1693b8\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"write\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"name: Test Hello World Scala\\\\n\\\\non:\\\\n  push:\\\\n    branches: [ main ]\\\\n  pull_request:\\\\n    branches: [ main ]\\\\n\\\\njobs:\\\\n  build-and-test:\\\\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\\\\n    steps:\\\\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\\\\n\\\\n      - name: Set up Scala\\\\n        use: scala-lang/setup-scala@v1\\\\n        with:\\\\n          scala-version: \\\\\\\"2.13.12\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n      - name: Compile and run HelloWorld\\\\n        run: |\\\\n          scalac HelloW