n also check if there's any existing Scala installation in the container by installing via apt.\\n\\nLet's try to install openjdk and then download the Scala binaries.\\n\\nWe'll do:\\n\\n```bash\\napt-get update && apt-get install -y openjdk-17-jdk wget\\nwget https://downloads.lightbend.com/scala/2.13.12/scala-2.13.12.tgz\\ntar xzf scala-2.13.12.tgz\\nexport PATH=$PATH:/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792256348663/scala-2.13.12/bin\\n```\\n\\nThen test.\\n\\nLet's do that quickly.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-eb0e4d8a-6ba8-4db2-b1e3-3b9d6602930b\",\"content\":\"Exit code 100\\nReading package lists...\\nE: List directory /var/lib/apt/lists/partial is missing. - Acquire (13: Permission denied)\\n\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-e39e1f07-7057-421b-8adf-946bfbb2c89d\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"sudo -n true 2>/dev/null && echo \\\\\\\"sudo works\\\\\\\" || echo \\\\\\\"sudo not available or needs password\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Check if sudo works\\\"}\"}}],\"reasoning\":\"We are having permission issues with apt. Let's try to fix by running with sudo? We are already root? The prompt shows we are box user. We can try sudo.\\n\\nBut note: we are in a container and might not have sudo. Let's check.\",\"reasoning_details\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"We are having permission issues with apt. Let's try to fix by running with sudo? We are already root? The prompt shows we are box user. We can try sudo.\\n\\nBut note: we are in a container and might not have sudo. Let's check.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-e39e1f07-7057-421b-8adf-946bfbb2c89d\",\"content\":\"sudo not available or needs password\\n\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-1baaa978-e4bd-4ab6-8ee9-d33d1259679f\",\"t