[2026-10-17T17:12:35.307Z] [INFO]         "diff": "Index: /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792256348663/ci/test-hello-world.yml\n===================================================================\n--- /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792256348663/ci/test-hello-world.yml\n+++ /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1792256348663/ci/test-hello-world.yml\n@@ -4,8 +4,9 @@\n   push:\n     branches: [ '**' ]\n   pull_request:\n     branches: [ '**' ]\n+  workflow_dispatch:\n \n jobs:\n   build-and-test:\n     runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n",
