ry branch or checks out our code in a specific way, and the workflow needs to be triggered by that specific action.\\n\\nLet me try making the workflow trigger on all branches, and then see if I can get it to run.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-48e49e99-edca-4d65-b617-76b501639fa4\",\"content\":\"\",\"name\":\"edit\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-17389865-45a8-412a-b727-9e8a8a19b3b0\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"git add ci/test-hello-world.yml\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Stage the updated workflow file\\\"}\"}}],\"reasoning\":\"Now let me commit and push this change.\",\"reasoning_details\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"Now let me commit and push this change.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-17389865-45a8-412a-b727-9e8a8a19b3b0\",\"content\":\"\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-64933e50-f9d7-43e1-9805-85a0dcd4089c\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"git commit -m \\\\\\\"Update GitHub Actions workflow to trigger on all branches\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Commit the workflow update\\\"}\"}}]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-64933e50-f9d7-43e1-9805-85a0dcd4089c\",\"content\":\"[issue-3487-f4cf27ad1f94 d94ddede5] Update GitHub Actions workflow to trigger on all branches\\n 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)\\n\",\"name\":\"bash\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":null,\"tool_calls\":[{\"id\":\"call-155c122f-23aa-4997-97e1-9cfec8d8bcb4\",\"type\":\"function\",\"function\":{\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"git push origin issue-3487-f4cf27ad1f94\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Push the updated workflow\\\"}\"}}],\"reasoning_details\":[]},{\"role\":\"tool\",\"tool_call_id\":\"call-155c122f-