The GitHub Actions workflow should be in `ci/` directory\n- The workflow should have a meaningful name like `test-hello-world.yml`\n- Save the workflow as `ci/test-hello-world.yml`, not under `.github/workflows/`: this repository's token cannot push workflow files, so the test harness copies it there and runs it\n\n## Definition of Done\n- [ ] Program file created with correct extension\n- [ ] Code prints \"Hello, World!\" exactly\n- [ ] Code is properly commented\n- [ ] Code follows Scala conventions\n- [ ] Instructions for running the program are included (if needed)\n- [ ] GitHub Actions workflow created and passing\n- [ ] CI badge showing build status (optional but recommended)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3487/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3487/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}[[]]{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/pulls/3488","id":4902110832,"node_id":"PR_kwDOPUU0qc8AAAABJDBGcA","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/3488","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/3488.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/3488.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/hive-mind/issues/3488","number":3488,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement Hello World in Scala","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%